## 📝 Conclusion

Manual testing was completed with **166 executed test cases**, achieving a **92.77% pass rate**.

The testing process identified 12 failed scenarios, with findings concentrated on content visibility, contact information, booking validation, and booking selection.

The documented results provide a structured overview of the website's tested functionality and areas requiring further attention.

